distinct color. That would destroy portal pairing.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:54:#    - The teal source is placed far enough from borders that all four portal squares fit and remain\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:56:#    - The chosen side-portal row band is searched explicitly so intended second-hit lanes are\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:57:#      contained while forbidden lanes are disjoint, preventing accidental extra portal hits.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:61:#      uniform, repeated color becomes the only plausible portal-pair signal.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:63:#      legend still supplies the repeated left/right clue for post-teleport turning.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:66:#    - The layout is a sparse cross: source near the middle, four isolated portal squares around it.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:79:#    - `main()` assumes portal paths do not cycle. The generator validates each sample with the same\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:80:#      portal oracle and rejects any layout that produces extra or cyclic hits.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:81:#    - `main()` assumes the portal rule changes behavior relative to plain in-place turning. The\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:82:#      generator compares against a non-portal trace and rejects degenerate layouts with zero output\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:101:# Source and portal geometry\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:172:def _collect_portals(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:175:    portals: dict[int, list[tuple[int, int, int, int]]] = {}\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:176:    portal_size: int | None = None\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:181:        assert len(rects) == 2, \"each used portal color must appear exactly twice\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:186:            assert hh == ww, \"portal components must be squares\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:187:            if portal_size is None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:188:                portal_size = hh\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:189:            assert hh == portal_size, \"all portal squares must share one size\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:191:        portals[color] = checked\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:192:    assert len(portals) >= 1, \"at least one portal pair must exist\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:193:    assert portal_size is not None\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:194:    return portals, portal_size\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:227:    assert (hit_h, hit_w) == (other_h, other_w), \"portal pairs must be congruent\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:230:        assert 0 <= offset <= hit_w - sz, \"portal hit must preserve a valid horizontal offset\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:235:    assert 0 <= offset <= hit_h - sz, \"portal hit must preserve a valid vertical offset\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:241:def _trace_portal_beams(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:248:    portals, _portal_size = _collect_portals(base, bg, teal)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:281:            assert oc in turns, \"portal color must be listed in the legend\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/24/code.py:282:            rects = p