10/D19/1/code.py:29:# - 原 solver 通过“组件中紧贴 plus 的像素集合”推方向，这部分仍然成立；但后续的 bbox 对齐断言\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/1/code.py:10:#      45 度方向滑动；每次落到一个拐点状态后，只有当其前进方向同侧紧贴黄色镜面条时，才会翻转一个轴并继续。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8b9c3697/5/code.py:21:#   bbox 内的某个 socket，而是“再前进一步就会撞到结构”的最后安全位置，也就是紧贴结构前脸的外侧。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D6/0/code.py:27:#         - 第二个容器的可停靠 slot 不再是目标线，而是“第一个容器后方紧贴的位置”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/38/code.py:33:#      teleport-style final square to a full black path.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/13e47133/D9/1/code.py:39:#      这层颜色穿过一格墙，覆盖区域 B 中紧贴这段墙的最外层边界。传播只改一层。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D1/2/code.py:33:#       V apex 紧贴断言，都依赖“输出是三相单调包裹”。这些前提在变体中不成立，必须整段移除。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/34/code.py:79:    - 橙色只在失败输出出现，且位置总紧贴浅蓝前沿\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D16/0/code.py:3:# Change: 障碍物紧贴在输出线段 V 形拐点的内侧（apex_inner），障碍物从拐点内侧向内生长；输入中线段不能 4-邻接障碍物... → 障碍物与 bar 对齐\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D1/0/code.py:45:#       source length varies from 2 to 3, so collision packing is visible rather than a single-point teleport\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/22/code.py:13:#   - The mover does not teleport. It repeatedly advances exactly K placement-steps along a\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/22/code.py:36:#     \"budget stop after K once\" or \"teleport to red directly\".\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/88bcf3b4/D7/1/code.py:53:- 关键线索是结构配对：哪条输出线段紧贴哪个障碍物，它就继承哪个障碍物的颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/28/code.py:93:def _portal_catalog() -> list[dict]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/28/code.py:219:def _apply_portals(grid: np.ndarray):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/28/code.py:220:    portal_count = random.randint(*PORTAL_COUNT_RANGE)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/28/code.py:221:    portals = random.sample(_portal_catalog(), portal_count)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/28/code.py:223:    for portal in portals:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/28/code.py:224:        orow, ocol = portal[\"opening\"]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/28/code.py:225:        brow, bcol = portal[\"blocker\"]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/28/code.py:230:    return portals, reserved\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/28/code.py:266:    _portals, reserved = _apply_portals(grid)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/28a6681f/D10/2/code.py:157:    - The new guide does not move water by teleportation; it only constrains those same motions inside a covered cavity until the outlet releases the water.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/67e490f4/D13/0/code.py:3:# Change: 精灵完全位于框架 bbox 外部，与框架和其他精灵之间保持至少 1 像素的切比雪夫距离间隔... → 精灵可紧贴框架边界\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/21/code.py:8:#    - Base task: each 3-pixel triangle encodes a direction, then \"teleports\" its\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/19/code.py:28:# - The visible change is strong: compared with the original hidden teleport, each\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:3:# Name: 射线到碰撞+传送门\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:18:#      paired portal. This combo uses two portal pairs so a ray can visibly traverse more than one warp.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:21:#      When a step lands on a portal pixel, the projectile immediately reappears at the paired portal and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:22:#      keeps the same direction; portal cells themselves are transit-only, not painted outputs.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:23:#    - Example trace: a down-right L could visit bg cells (4,4),(5,5), step onto portal A at (6,6),\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:24:#      emerge a